'''Galarian Mr. Rime''' (Japanese: '''ガラルバリコオル''' ''Galarian Barrikohru'') is a {{ct|Water}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Fantastical Parade}} expansion.

