==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Darkness Ablaze|Galarian Mr. Rime|36}} from the {{TCG|Darkness Ablaze}} expansion.
*'''Triple Spin''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Aquapolis|Hitmontop|82}} from the {{TCG|Aquapolis}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

